SUMMARY:Walk Duke Wall
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nY’all know I love a walk! Come joi
 n me doing a couple of laps around Duke Wall.\n\nWe’re gonna meet in fro
 nt of the crosswalk across from Sedgefield St. and will continue up Markha
 m toward N. Buchanan when we start. I’m going to try to start right arou
 nd 6:30\, so let me know if you’re running late in the chat so I know to
  wait.\n\nI recommend street parking in Trinity Heights as they do tow at 
 the businesses around the wall.\n\nLooking forward to seeing y’all there
 !
