SUMMARY:Hammered Trivia at Durty Bull
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nIt’s Trivia Time! Come out for som
 e Sunday afternoon Hammered Trivia at Durty Bull and test your trivia know
 ledge.\n\nDurty Bull has some limited parking in the lot\, but also has a 
 lot of street parking around it\, so I don’t usually struggle to find a 
 spot. I’ll try to get there a little early\, so feel free to message me 
 if you have any trouble finding everybody.
